{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14806","headline":"和金吾裴将军使往河北宣慰因访张氏昆季旧居兼寄赵侍郎赵卿拜陵未回 · 卢纶","name":"和金吾裴将军使往河北宣慰因访张氏昆季旧居兼寄赵侍郎赵卿拜陵未回","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞轩不驻轮，感激汉儒臣。\n气慑千夫勇，恩传万里春。\n古原收野燎，寒笛怨空邻。\n书此达良友，五陵风雨频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14806.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14806","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}